# POLLY, PLAY's count-in: from a stop with a recording armed, PLAY plays one bar of the click first (its downbeat high,
# the others low; even with CLICK off), the band silent and standing at its start ("Count-in 4" up top, the beats
# left big in the bar it starts on), then starts as PLAY does, recording live from its first beat: an instrument (its
# tick 0), a new progression's take (its beat 0), a melody (its section's first beat; the Intro is not played while a
# melody records, as before). A key in the count-in only sounds; one a little early lands on the first beat. PLAY in
# the count-in stops (REC stays armed). MIDI out is on (the default): the click's notes go out on channel 16
# (clicks_out); MIDI start only when the band starts. Keys (octave 0): key K is MIDI 53 + K. 120 BPM: a bar is 2 s.
wait 300
spin K2 15
expect tempo 120
# CLICK off (Setup): the count-in clicks anyway, nothing after it
tap GLO
turn K4 -1
expect click 0
# ---- an instrument: LOOP P1, SEQ, C1 erased, REC armed while stopped
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
expect mode 1
tap SEQ
expect page 6
expect track 5
tap SEL
spin SELECT 20
spin SELECT -3
wait 159
tap SEL
expect asking 1
tap SEL
wait 100
expect slot1_trk5_count 0
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 1
expect rec_wait 1
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 1
expect count_in 4
expect heard_ch16 84
wait 700
expect count_in 3
expect heard_ch16 77
expect clicks_out 2
wait 100
shot band_count_in.png
# a key in the count-in: it sounds, not kept
tapkey 7
wait 800
expect count_in 1
expect rec_wait 1
expect clicks_out 4
expect track_hits1 0
expect track_hits2 0
expect track_hits3 0
expect track_hits4 0
expect track_hits6 0
expect track_hits7 0
expect track_hits8 0
# a key a little early (40 ms): on the band's first beat, tick 0
wait 90
key 19 down
wait 300
key 19 up
wait 100
expect count_in 0
expect rec_wait 0
expect track_hits1 >0
wait 2000
expect clicks_out 4
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 0
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect slot1_trk5_count 1
expect slot1_trk5_tick0 0
# ---- PLAY in the count-in: a stop, nothing started (REC stays armed)
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 1
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect count_in 3
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect playing 0
expect count_in 0
expect recording 1
expect track_hits1 0
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 0
# ---- a new progression: Home, Prog "-" (free), REC, PLAY: a chord in the count-in only sounds; the one on the band's
# first beat is the take's beat 0
tap HOME
expect page 0
turn K4 -20
expect mode 0
tap REC
expect take 1
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect take 1
expect count_in 2
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 100
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
wait 100
shot home_count_in.png
wait 900
expect take 2
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 100
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 2000
tap REC
expect take 0
expect loop_bars9 1
expect loop_ch9_0 0
expect loop_ch9_1 -1
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
# ---- a melody: a song of one section (P1), its Intro on; Sound, M1, REC (the song first), PLAY: the count-in, then
# section 1 (no Intro while a melody records) from its first beat; a key a little early: the section's place 0
tap HOME
wait 80
expect page 1
tapkey w0
expect rows 1
turn SELECT 1
expect song_intro 1
turn SELECT -1
tap EDIT
turn ALGO 4
expect lead_sel 1
tap REC
wait 50
expect recording 1
expect mode 2
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect count_in 4
expect row 1
shot melody_count_in.png
wait 1680
key 7 down
wait 400
key 7 up
expect count_in 0
expect sect 2
wait 600
tap REC
wait 50
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect lead_notes 1
expect lead1_pos 0
expect lead1_note 60
